@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 28
title Statechart · Each Attempt ends once; retry creates another identity\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/models.py#L48
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L136
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L170
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L184
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/recovery.py#L24
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L186
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L412

top to bottom direction
state queued $PROC
state processing $PROC
state "Terminal Attempt states (persisted rows)" as End $PROC {
 state succeeded <<terminal>>
 state failed <<terminal>>
 state abandoned <<terminal>>
 state cancelled <<terminal>>
 succeeded -[hidden]right-> failed
 failed -[hidden]right-> abandoned
 abandoned -[hidden]right-> cancelled
}
[*] --> queued : create / new UUID
queued --> processing : claim [current, queued, not deleted]\n/ token + lease + task binding
processing --> processing : heartbeat [live]\n/ renew lease capped by deadline
processing --> succeeded : finish [live, valid outputs, error is None]\n/ Job=done
processing --> failed : finish [live, error is not None]\n/ Job=failed
processing --> abandoned : interrupt [interrupted]\n/ Job=failed
processing --> abandoned : redirect_to_long_lane [live]\n/ NEW Attempt; Job=queued
queued --> cancelled : _cancel_locked\n/ finished_at + expired lease
processing --> cancelled : _cancel_locked\n/ finished_at + expired lease
legend bottom
Terminal rows never return to queued. Rows are retained; no final node is drawn. Retry creates a new UUID/number.
interrupted = current nondeleted processing pair AND (expired lease/deadline OR matched STOPPED).
live is evaluated on lock_pair: current nondeleted Job + processing states + same token + DB now before lease/deadline.
endlegend

@enduml
